        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>欢迎加入我们的讨论群：575570398</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173920/extras/90afe4ae631d5f914a2eb595977e5667.poster.avif?t=1753202394\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173920/extras/90afe4ae631d5f914a2eb595977e5667.webm?t=1753202394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173920/extras/90afe4ae631d5f914a2eb595977e5667.mp4?t=1753202394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>这是一款俯视角射击轻度肉鸽游戏</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >流畅丝滑的战斗手感，对手柄操作完全支持</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >快速的战斗节奏，25分钟左右即可完成一轮</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >粗鄙又低俗的文案，平日里不方便怼人的话就来这里发泄一下</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >幽默的装备系统，你可以找到各式各样的梗</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >独特的养成玩法，想方设法提高你的伤害吧</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >近30种不同的搞怪敌人和7个强大的BOSS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10把不同能力的武器，探索不同的搭配方案</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10个难度可供挑战</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >支持成就系统</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>最关键的是</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >轻视操作，更重视道具的组合搭配，绝对不用担心因为操作不好而无法过关。你只可能因为道具搭配组合不顺畅而暴毙。</p></li></ul>",
